{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-time-source-architecture","title":"云时钟源架构：厂商 NTP/PTP 托管服务、多源冗余与区域时钟策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/time-synchronization-ntp-ptp-chrony-engineering/cloud-monitoring-leap-distributed-correctness/cloud-time-source-architecture","wordCount":2568,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"云时钟源架构-厂商-ntp-ptp-托管服务-多源冗余与区域时钟策略\">云时钟源架构：厂商 NTP/PTP 托管服务、多源冗余与区域时钟策略</h1><p>自建 Stratum-1 NTP 服务器需要 GPS 天线、恒温晶振、机房视野，还要担心天线进了雷击区。公有云把这件事变成了一个链路本地 IP：EC2 上 <code>169.254.169.123</code>（AWS <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/set-time.html\">Amazon Time Sync Service</a>），Azure 上是 <code>/dev/ptp_hyperv</code> 这个 PTP 设备（Azure <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/linux/time-sync\">Time sync for Linux VMs</a>），GCE 上是 <code>metadata.google.internal</code>。本文只讲「云上的时钟源怎么选、怎么配、出错时怎么退」，不重复 NTP 报文细节——协议与 chrony 语法见兄弟文档 <a href=\"../ntp-protocol-chrony-operations/chrony-deployment-configuration\">NTP 协议与 chrony 部署</a>，PHC 与透明时钟的硬件机制见 <a href=\"../ptp-ieee1588-high-precision/ptp-hardware-timestamping-transparent-clock\">PTP 硬件时间戳与透明时钟</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-厂商把时间做成了托管服务\">核心概念：厂商把时间做成了托管服务</h2><p>三种云厂商给出的时钟源形态不同，但架构模式一致：<strong>每个 Region 内铺设一组卫星/原子参考时钟，通过链路本地地址暴露给宿主机，再由宿主机/驱动把时间传给虚机</strong>。链路本地的意义是这段流量不出 VPC，不受公网抖动和中间设备排队影响。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Region 内卫星 + 原子参考时钟] --&gt; B[宿主机时间源]&#10;    B --&gt;|链路本地 NTP| C[VM 的 chronyd&lt;br/&gt;169.254.169.123]&#10;    B --&gt;|Hyper-V / ENA 驱动| D[虚机内 PTP 设备&lt;br/&gt;/dev/ptp_hyperv 或 /dev/ptp_ena]&#10;    D --&gt;|refclock PHC| C&#10;    C --&gt; E[CLOCK_REALTIME&lt;br/&gt;供应用读取]&#10;    F[公网池 time.aws.com&lt;br/&gt;time.google.com] --&gt;|备份 / 公网资源| C\">graph TD\n    A[Region 内卫星 + 原子参考时钟] --&gt; B[宿主机时间源]\n    B --&gt;|链路本地 NTP| C[VM 的 chronyd&lt;br/&gt;169.254.169.123]\n    B --&gt;|Hyper-V / ENA 驱动| D[虚机内 PTP 设备&lt;br/&gt;/dev/ptp_hyperv 或 /dev/ptp_ena]\n    D --&gt;|refclock PHC| C\n    C --&gt; E[CLOCK_REALTIME&lt;br/&gt;供应用读取]\n    F[公网池 time.aws.com&lt;br/&gt;time.google.com] --&gt;|备份 / 公网资源| C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>主时钟源</th>\n<th>备份/公网源</th>\n<th>是否提供 PTP</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AWS</td>\n<td>链路本地 <code>169.254.169.123</code>（IPv4）/ <code>fd00:ec2::123</code>（IPv6，仅 Nitro）</td>\n<td>公网 <code>time.aws.com</code></td>\n<td>是，<code>precision-time</code> 放置组内的 Linux 实例有 <code>/dev/ptp_ena</code>，微秒级</td>\n<td>链路本地流量共享 1024 PPS 限额（含 IMDS 与 DNS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Azure</td>\n<td>宿主机时间，经 VMICTimeSync 暴露为 <code>/dev/ptp_hyperv</code></td>\n<td>公网 NTP（如 <code>ntp.ubuntu.com</code>）</td>\n<td>是，内核 ≥4.11 或 RHEL 7 ≥3.10.0-693</td>\n<td>stratum 不由宿主自动传递，需在配置里手工声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GCP</td>\n<td>每 VM 的 <code>metadata.google.internal</code>（虚拟 IP <code>169.254.169.254</code>）</td>\n<td>Google Public NTP（同一套 smear 逻辑）</td>\n<td>文档未提供面向 VM 的 PTP 源</td>\n<td>Windows VM 建议 gVNIC 以拿到亚毫秒精度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三家的错源（公网池）都做了<strong>闰秒涂抹（leap smearing）</strong>：AWS 与 Google 都把多出的一秒摊到 24 小时内加减（Google 是前后各 12 小时），因此你从公网拿到的时间从不出现 23:59:60。这张表里最容易被忽视的一列是「是否提供 PTP」——它不是精度偏好，而是决定了你能否走后面讲的免 smear 通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aws-precision-time-放置组与-phc-的两条路径\">AWS：precision-time 放置组与 PHC 的两条路径</h2><p>AWS 的设计分两层，理解它需要区分「有没有进 precision-time 放置组」。<strong>任意 EC2 实例</strong>都能访问链路本地 NTP 源，用 <code>chronyc sources -v</code> 会看到宿主机呈现为 Stratum 4：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"server 169.254.169.123 prefer iburst minpoll 4 maxpoll 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>server 169.254.169.123 prefer iburst minpoll 4 maxpoll 4</span></span></code></pre></div><p>进了 <code>precision-time</code> 放置组的实例，同一个 <code>169.254.169.123</code> 会升级为 <strong>Stratum 1</strong>，chrony 报的 <code>Root dispersion</code> 从几百微秒掉到几十微秒级别（AWS 文档示例中 <code>+/- 91us</code> vs 未加速的 <code>+/- 287us</code>）。放置组通过 CLI 创建：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"aws ec2 create-placement-group --group-name my-precision-time-pg --strategy precision-time\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aws</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ec2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create-placement-group</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --group-name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-precision-time-pg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --strategy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> precision-time</span></span></code></pre></div><p>支持的是 Gen7 及以后家族（M7a/M7g/M7i、C7a/C7g/C7i、R7a/R7g/R7i、I8g/I8ge 等）。<strong>关键限制</strong>：放置组依赖专用硬件，容量不足时启动请求直接失败——自动扩缩容时必须有退路。</p>\n<p>第二层是 <strong>PHC</strong>。Linux 实例在放置组内可通过 ENA 驱动拿到 <code>/dev/ptp_ena</code>（需 ENA 驱动 ≥2.10.0，编译时带 <code>ENA_PHC_INCLUDE=1</code>），然后让 chrony 以 refclock 方式使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"refclock PHC /dev/ptp_ena poll 0 delay 0.000010 prefer\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>refclock PHC /dev/ptp_ena poll 0 delay 0.000010 prefer</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>prefer</code> 让 PHC 成为首选源，此时 <code>chronyc sources</code> 里 PHC0 显示为 Stratum 0，NTP 源退居 Stratum 1。<code>delay 0.000010</code> 是 10 微秒的固定补偿，用于吸收驱动打戳路径的已知偏置。</p>\n<p><strong>免 smear 通道就在 PHC 上。</strong> AWS 明确写了：NTP 链路本地源和公网池都做闰秒涂抹，但 <strong>PHC 不涂抹</strong>——闰秒发生时 PHC 按 UTC 标准直接加这一秒。这不是细节，而是分布式系统的两难：涂抹让「秒长恒定」，代价是 smear 期间写出的时间戳与标准 UTC 有最多约 0.5 秒的偏差；不涂抹让时间戳严格贴合 UTC，代价是出现 23:59:60 这一秒，所有把它当合法值的代码都可能出问题。AWS 建议<strong>不要在同一个时间客户端里混用涂抹与非涂抹源</strong>——两者在闰秒那一刻是不一致的，混合配置会让 chrony 观测到一个矛盾的偏移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"azure-与-gcp-宿主时间作为一等公民\">Azure 与 GCP：宿主时间作为一等公民</h2><p>Azure 的模型是「宿主时间就是最好的源」。VMICTimeSync（属于 <code>hv_utils</code> 集成服务）做两件事：宿主维护后立即校正 VM 的 time-of-day，以及把宿主时间暴露为一个 PTP 设备。宿主本身同步到微软自有的 Stratum-1 设备（带 GPS 天线）。</p>\n<p>Azure 上踩坑最多的是设备名。<code>/dev/ptp0</code> 不一定是宿主：开启加速网络时 Mellanox <code>mlx5</code> 驱动也会注册一个 PTP 设备，且<strong>初始化顺序每次启动可能不同</strong>。稳定锚点是 <code>/dev/ptp_hyperv</code> 这个 udev 软链接。配置写成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"refclock PHC /dev/ptp_hyperv poll 3 dpoll -2 offset 0 stratum 2&#10;makestep 1.0 -1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>refclock PHC /dev/ptp_hyperv poll 3 dpoll -2 offset 0 stratum 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>makestep 1.0 -1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个细节值得记住。其一，<strong>stratum 不会自动从宿主传到 guest</strong>，上面显式声明宿主源为 Stratum 2，从而 guest 报告为 Stratum 3——如果集群里还有真实 NTP 客户端参与选源，声明错误会让选举结果错乱。其二，<code>makestep 1.0 -1</code> 是必需的：chrony 默认靠加减频率慢慢追，但宿主维护（内存保留式维护会让 VM 暂停最多 30 秒）造成的偏移远超 slew 能力，必须允许直接 step。若宿主的 PTP 设备不可用（老内核 &lt;4.11），只能退回公网 NTP，此时请核对 <code>chronyc sources</code> 确认真的在同步——历史上很多 Azure 市场镜像是「根本没有时间服务在跑」。</p>\n<p>GCP 侧更简单：GCE 建议只配一个源 <code>metadata.google.internal</code>，不要混入外部 NTP。Google 只对 Windows VM 用 gVNIC 给出「亚毫秒」的措辞，对 Linux 不提供 SLA 级精度保证——<code>chronyc</code> 输出里的微秒值是示例而非承诺。Google 的涂抹窗口是闰秒前后各 12 小时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多源冗余-为什么-只配一个-在公网可行-在内网不行\">多源冗余：为什么「只配一个」在公网可行、在内网不行</h2><p>单源配置的合理性完全取决于源的可用性与可达性。<code>metadata.google.internal</code> 由云控制平面保证高可用，配一个就够；而自建或自托管的 NTP 源，冗余的判据不是「配了几个 <code>server</code> 行」，而是<strong>这些源在故障域上是否独立</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"server ntp1.corp.example.com iburst&#10;server ntp2.corp.example.com iburst\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>server ntp1.corp.example.com iburst</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server ntp2.corp.example.com iburst</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果 ntp1 与 ntp2 是同一台 Stratum-1 的两个 NIC、同一机架、同一上行链路，网络分区时会同时消失。真正独立的判据是：不同上游参考时钟、不同机房、不同运营商路径。云上的正确做法是<strong>混合层次</strong>——宿主 PHC 作首选（<code>prefer</code>），链路本地 NTP 作次级，公网池作末级备份：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"refclock PHC /dev/ptp_ena poll 0 delay 0.000010 prefer&#10;server 169.254.169.123 iburst minpoll 4 maxpoll 4&#10;server time.aws.com iburst\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>refclock PHC /dev/ptp_ena poll 0 delay 0.000010 prefer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server 169.254.169.123 iburst minpoll 4 maxpoll 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server time.aws.com iburst</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>但混合层次引入了脏数据入池风险</strong>。chrony 的选源算法（见兄弟文档 <a href=\"../ntp-protocol-chrony-operations/ntp-protocol-modes-selection-algorithm\">NTP 选源算法与协议模式</a>）会通过交叉比对剔除「说谎者」，前提是源之间时间一致。如果某一层在上游漂移，看起来就像本地源有问题。生产上要监控的核心指标不是单一 offset，而是源的<strong>离散度</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>slv</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{\\text{slv}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\sum_i w_i (\\theta_i - \\bar{\\theta})^2}{\\sum_i w_i}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.1385em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9015em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5209em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1385em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>离散度突然变大，通常意味着某个上游源的频率变了，或路径引入了不对称延迟——用 <code>chronyc sourcestats</code> 看每个源的 <code>Skew</code> 与 <code>RMS offset</code> 比看总的 offset 有用得多。误差预算的完整推导见 <a href=\"../clock-hardware-timescale-foundations/clock-offset-skew-error-budget\">时钟偏移、偏差与误差预算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区域时钟策略与误差预算\">区域时钟策略与误差预算</h2><p>跨 Region 架构里「时间一致」有两种读法，选错会写出错误的合并逻辑。第一种是<strong>每台机器贴合 UTC</strong>：各机误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，任意两机偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le \\epsilon_1 + \\epsilon_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，云时钟源的目标就是压小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>——链路本地 NTP 典型几百微秒，precision-time 的 PHC 到微秒级。第二种是<strong>机器间相对一致</strong>，需要显式误差上界而非假设时钟绝对正确。Google 的 Spanner 是后者的极端实现：它不信任物理时钟本身，而是让 TrueTime 给出带不确定区间的 <code>TT.now()</code>，返回区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t - \\epsilon, t + \\epsilon]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，并在提交时等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 以确保后续事务的时间戳严格更大。这个代价与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 成正比——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，每次提交等待越久。因此 Spanner 这类系统必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 压到毫秒级，而这只有在「同一 Region 内大量主机共享高度可靠时钟源」的前提下才成立。</p>\n<p>云时钟源选择因此变成一道架构题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>建议源</th>\n<th>典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>闰秒处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日志时间戳、事件排序（松散）</td>\n<td>链路本地 NTP</td>\n<td>数百微秒</td>\n<td>用涂抹源，避免 23:59:60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式事务、外部一致读</td>\n<td>宿主 PTP（<code>/dev/ptp_*</code>）</td>\n<td>微秒级</td>\n<td>需明确选涂抹或非涂抹，不可混用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络单向延迟测量</td>\n<td>PHC + 硬件打戳</td>\n<td>纳秒级打戳栅格</td>\n<td>直接读 PHC，绕过 NTP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨 Region 强一致读</td>\n<td>每 Region 单独取上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\epsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>累加</td>\n<td>需统一的 smear 策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>跨 Region 的误差是累加的。</strong> 两地的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 各自独立，最坏情况下相对偏差是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_A + \\epsilon_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着「跨 Region 时间戳排序」假设的可靠性取决于最慢那个 Region 的时钟质量。规范做法是让所有 Region 使用同一套 smear 策略（要么都涂、要么都不涂），否则闰秒事件会在 Region 之间制造一个持续约 24 小时的系统性偏移——而这不会触发任何明显的 offset 告警，因为每台机器相对 UTC 都是「对的」。</p>\n<p><strong>监控上必须显式补齐的一环</strong>：云厂商的托管时钟源是黑盒，无法用 <code>ntpdate</code> 独立验证。可核验的替代手段是 (1) 在应用层读取 <code>chronyc tracking</code> 的 <code>Root dispersion</code> 与 <code>Leap status</code> 并上报；(2) 用有独立 GNSS 的第三方参考做长期漂移比对；(3) 对 PHC 源，用 <code>ethtool -T</code> 确认硬件打戳没有在内核/驱动升级后被静默降级——这类降级曾多次发生，且 chrony 仍会报收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>云上时钟源是托管服务：AWS <code>169.254.169.123</code> + <code>precision-time</code> 放置组的 <code>/dev/ptp_ena</code>，Azure <code>/dev/ptp_hyperv</code>（靠 udev 软链接规避 mlx5 干扰），GCP <code>metadata.google.internal</code>。</li>\n<li>链路本地源不出 VPC，精度远好于公网池；AWS 进放置组后同一 IP 从 Stratum 4 升到 Stratum 1，<code>Root dispersion</code> 从数百微秒降到几十微秒。</li>\n<li>冗余的正确判据是故障域独立，不是 <code>server</code> 行数；云上推荐「PHC prefer + 链路本地 NTP + 公网池」分层，但要监控源离散度而非单一 offset。</li>\n<li>闰秒是涂抹/非涂抹的二选一：AWS 的 NTP 源涂抹、PHC 不涂抹，<strong>同一客户端不可混用</strong>；跨 Region 必须统一策略，否则会制造一个不触发 offset 告警的系统性偏移。</li>\n<li>跨 Region 的相对误差上界是各 Region <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 之和，决定了「时间戳排序」类假设的可靠性上限。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"云时钟源架构：厂商 NTP/PTP 托管服务、多源冗余与区域时钟策略","id":"云时钟源架构-厂商-ntp-ptp-托管服务-多源冗余与区域时钟策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：厂商把时间做成了托管服务","id":"核心概念-厂商把时间做成了托管服务"},{"level":2,"text":"AWS：precision-time 放置组与 PHC 的两条路径","id":"aws-precision-time-放置组与-phc-的两条路径"},{"level":2,"text":"Azure 与 GCP：宿主时间作为一等公民","id":"azure-与-gcp-宿主时间作为一等公民"},{"level":2,"text":"多源冗余：为什么「只配一个」在公网可行、在内网不行","id":"多源冗余-为什么-只配一个-在公网可行-在内网不行"},{"level":2,"text":"区域时钟策略与误差预算","id":"区域时钟策略与误差预算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PTP 部署调优与排障：网卡/交换机配置、G.8275 剖面、精度度量与异常诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/time-synchronization-ntp-ptp-chrony-engineering/ptp-ieee1588-high-precision/ptp-deployment-tuning-troubleshooting"},"next":{"title":"时间可观测性：chrony/PTP 指标、时钟偏差告警、SLO 与混沌测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/time-synchronization-ntp-ptp-chrony-engineering/cloud-monitoring-leap-distributed-correctness/time-observability-monitoring-slo"}}